{"page":90,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"82","words":[{"text":"82","x":236,"y":132,"width":50,"height":36}]},{"text":"CHAPTER02 • 애물리케이션 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER02","x":623,"y":134,"width":168,"height":26},{"text":"•","x":824,"y":142,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"애물리케이션","x":868,"y":136,"width":157,"height":30},{"text":"계층","x":1038,"y":137,"width":50,"height":30}]},{"text":"트의 주소와. (2) 그 목적지 호스트 내의 수신 프로세스를 명시하는 식별지1","words":[{"text":"트의","x":601,"y":265,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"주소와.","x":680,"y":265,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"(2)","x":804,"y":270,"width":43,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":860,"y":270,"width":33,"height":27},{"text":"목적지","x":905,"y":265,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"호스트","x":1018,"y":269,"width":99,"height":30},{"text":"내의","x":1131,"y":267,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":1208,"y":266,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스를","x":1287,"y":266,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"명시하는","x":1470,"y":267,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"식별지1","x":1619,"y":269,"width":106,"height":39}]},{"text":"인터넷에서 호스트는 IP 주소로 식별된다. 4징에서 IP 주소를 보다 자세히 다품","words":[{"text":"인터넷에서","x":669,"y":326,"width":162,"height":38},{"text":"호스트는","x":852,"y":328,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"IP","x":1000,"y":330,"width":38,"height":30},{"text":"주소로","x":1054,"y":329,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"식별된다.","x":1172,"y":327,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"4징에서","x":1327,"y":326,"width":118,"height":39},{"text":"IP","x":1466,"y":331,"width":33,"height":30},{"text":"주소를","x":1516,"y":330,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"보다","x":1635,"y":331,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"자세히","x":1719,"y":331,"width":90,"height":38},{"text":"다품","x":1828,"y":341,"width":52,"height":42}]},{"text":"것이다. 지금은 IP 주소가 32비트로 구성되며, 호스트를 유안하기l씌별한다는 것만 기","words":[{"text":"것이다.","x":603,"y":386,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"지금은","x":729,"y":387,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"IP","x":840,"y":391,"width":32,"height":28},{"text":"주소가","x":887,"y":386,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"32비트로","x":999,"y":386,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"구성되며,","x":1150,"y":387,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"호스트를","x":1306,"y":389,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"유안하기l씌별한다는","x":1450,"y":388,"width":322,"height":40},{"text":"것만","x":1787,"y":393,"width":56,"height":40},{"text":"기","x":1855,"y":410,"width":21,"height":38}]},{"text":"억하자. 메시지가 전달되어야 하는 호스트의 주소를 이는 것과 더불어 송신 호스트`느","words":[{"text":"억하자.","x":602,"y":446,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"메시지가","x":727,"y":446,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"전달되어야","x":879,"y":446,"width":163,"height":38},{"text":"하는","x":1057,"y":447,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"호스트의","x":1138,"y":448,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"주소를","x":1285,"y":449,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"이는","x":1400,"y":447,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"것과","x":1486,"y":449,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"더불어","x":1568,"y":449,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"송신","x":1682,"y":451,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"호스트`느","x":1763,"y":453,"width":114,"height":41}]},{"text":"수신 호스트에서 수행되고 있는 수신 프로세스(좀 더 자세히는 수신 소켓)도 식별해0k","words":[{"text":"수신","x":599,"y":506,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"호스트에서","x":680,"y":507,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"수행되고","x":862,"y":507,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1010,"y":506,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":1087,"y":507,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스(좀","x":1167,"y":508,"width":179,"height":39},{"text":"더","x":1361,"y":508,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"자세히는","x":1407,"y":508,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":1555,"y":510,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"소켓)도","x":1637,"y":512,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"식별해0k","x":1764,"y":511,"width":112,"height":53}]},{"text":"한다. 이 정보는 일반적으로 한 호스트가 많은 네트워크 응우을 수행할 수 있기 때문의","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":599,"y":565,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":690,"y":566,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"정보는","x":738,"y":566,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"일반적으로","x":850,"y":56