MTp","x":1781,"y":695,"width":92,"height":43}]},{"text":"프로토콜을 사용하는) 메일 서버는 포트 번호 25번으로 식별된다. 인터넷 표준 프구노","words":[{"text":"프로토콜을","x":599,"y":749,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"사용하는)","x":781,"y":749,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"메일","x":939,"y":747,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"서버는","x":1018,"y":748,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"포트","x":1130,"y":752,"width":66,"height":29},{"text":"번호","x":1211,"y":750,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"25번으로","x":1289,"y":750,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"식별된다.","x":1442,"y":751,"width":141,"height":37},{"text":"인터넷","x":1601,"y":751,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"표준","x":1713,"y":752,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"프구노","x":1790,"y":756,"width":83,"height":45}]},{"text":"콜들에 대한 잘 알려진(well-known) 포트 번호 리스트는 http://www.iana.org/서 찾","words":[{"text":"콜들에","x":598,"y":809,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"대한","x":715,"y":810,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"잘","x":795,"y":809,"width":33,"height":39},{"text":"알려진(well-known)","x":842,"y":809,"width":303,"height":40},{"text":"포트","x":1160,"y":814,"width":66,"height":29},{"text":"번호","x":1242,"y":811,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"리스트는","x":1324,"y":811,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"http://www.iana.org/서","x":1470,"y":813,"width":363,"height":42},{"text":"찾","x":1848,"y":825,"width":25,"height":42}]},{"text":"이볼 수 있다. 3장에서 보다 자세히 포트 번호를 살펴볼 것이다.","words":[{"text":"이볼","x":599,"y":870,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":678,"y":870,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":726,"y":871,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"3장에서","x":812,"y":870,"width":115,"height":40},{"text":"보다","x":942,"y":870,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"자세히","x":1021,"y":870,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"포트","x":1131,"y":874,"width":66,"height":29},{"text":"번호를","x":1212,"y":872,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"살펴볼","x":1323,"y":873,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":1438,"y":873,"width":105,"height":38}]},{"text":"2.13 애플리케이션이 이용기능한트랜스포트서비스","words":[{"text":"2.13","x":599,"y":984,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"애플리케이션이","x":766,"y":982,"width":279,"height":46},{"text":"이용기능한트랜스포트서비스","x":1062,"y":982,"width":568,"height":48}]},{"text":"소켓이 애플리게이션 프로세스와 트랜스포트 프로토콜 간의 인터페이스라는 것을 상","words":[{"text":"소켓이","x":598,"y":1080,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"애플리게이션","x":714,"y":1081,"width":197,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스와","x":928,"y":1081,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1108,"y":1081,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜","x":1290,"y":1085,"width":134,"height":35},{"text":"간의","x":1440,"y":1084,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"인터페이스라는","x":1525,"y":1084,"width":235,"height":39},{"text":"것을","x":1777,"y":1087,"width":57,"height":39},{"text":"상","x":1847,"y":1098,"width":25,"height":37}]},{"text":"기하자. 송신 측의 애플리케이션은 그 소켓을 통해 메시지를 보낸다. 그 소켓의 반대며","words":[{"text":"기하자.","x":599,"y":1141,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"송신","x":719,"y":1141,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"측의","x":797,"y":1141,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션은","x":878,"y":1141,"width":231,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1121,"y":1147,"width":33,"height":25},{"text":"소켓을","x":1166,"y":1142,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"통해","x":1278,"y":1144,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"메시지를","x":1359,"y":1144,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"보낸다.","x":1505,"y":1144,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1630,"y":1150,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"소켓의","x":1676,"y":1146,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"반대며","x":1789,"y":1148,"width":79,"height":41}]},{"text":"에서 트랜스포트 프로토콜은 네트워크를 통해 그 메시지를 수신 프로세스의 소켓으로","words":[{"text":"에서","x":598,"y":1201,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":677,"y":1201,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":856,"y":1203,"width":167,"height":36},{"text":"네트워크를","x":1037,"y":1202,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"통해","x":1216,"y":1204,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":1296,"y":1210,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"메시지를","x":1344,"y":1205,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":1491,"y":1205,"width":67,"height":37},{"text